  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ukraina:SKL projektdokument U-LEAD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine:SKL project document U-LEAD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida anlitar SKL f&#xf6;r att skriva ett projekt dokument f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra det f&#xf6;rsta &#xe5;ret av det EU-finansierade projektet U-LEAD, Ukraine Local Empowerment, Accountability and Democracy programme, component 2 Administrative service centres and public awareness-raising. F&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra uppdraget ska SKL samla information fr&#xe5;n olika k&#xe4;llor och tr&#xe4;ffa alla relevanta akt&#xf6;rer i Ukraina och presentera ett full&#xf6;digt projektf&#xf6;rslag till Sida senast 26 februari 2016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida contracts SALAR to write a project document to implement the first year of the EU-funded poject U-LEAD, Ukraine Local Empowerment, Acountability and Democracy programme, component 2 Administrative service centres and public awareness-raising. To implement the assignment, SALAR will collect information from different sources and meet with all relevant stakeholders in Ukraine and present a complete project proposal to Sida not later than 26 February 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
